data: {"type": "assistant_msg", "ts": "2026-08-06T12:15:38.393718+00:00", "content": "**Hardware Temperature Comparison Across All P Routers (pop1 core)**\n\n| Router | Device Temp (\u00b0C) | Transceiver Temp eth1 (\u00b0C) |\n|--------|------------------|----------------------------|\n| p1     | 28.974 [metrics:0] | 37.05 [metrics:1] |\n| p2     | 28.979 [metrics:2] | 37.029 [metrics:3] |\n| p3     | 28.759 [metrics:4] | 36.673 [metrics:5] |\n| p4     | 28.95 [metrics:6]  | 36.544 [metrics:7] |\n\n**Summary**\n- **Device temperatures** are tightly clustered between **28.76\u201328.98 \u00b0C** \u2014 well within normal operating range.\n- **Transceiver (eth1) temperatures** range from **36.54\u201337.05 \u00b0C**, also normal and consistent across the four P routers.\n- No outliers or thermal concerns detected at the current snapshot (ts=1786018472)."}

